 'w-s2o':{zh:'Snap-to-Object',en:'Snap-to-Object',t:['WEKA Snap-to-Object 与云上暂停恢复','WEKA Snap-to-Object for Cloud Pause and Restart'],lines:['w-prot'],pos:{weka:7},tag:'weka',lv:2,st:'live',page:'topics/w-s2o/index.html',steps:6,prev:['w-snap','w-policy','obj'],next:['w-cloud','w-diff'],d:['Snap-to-Object 在对象桶保留可恢复快照，云实例停止后仍可按定位符重建文件系统。','Snap-to-Object retains a recoverable snapshot in an object bucket so a filesystem can be recreated by locator after cloud instances stop.'],kw:['暂停与重启','Pause and Restart']},

